  "contract": [
    "The user-scope General registration renders a Sync action opening the shared sync-agent-configs-dialog. Its helper forwards an omitted disabled prop rather than adding a cloud gate.",
    "The mounted dialog reads a fresh diff on opening. It presents MCP servers, slash commands and skills in that order. Categories start collapsed; all missing items start selected via empty deselection sets.",
    "Diffs compare names, not changed contents. Existing same-name entries are not offered for overwrite. A category read error is reported for that category while other categories can load.",
    "Skills are non-hidden directories containing SKILL.md. Skill copy omits .git, node_modules and .DS_Store. Root SKILL.md imported to Codex gets basic frontmatter if absent. Partial failed skill copies are removed by the frontend request chain.",
    "Slash command names come from recursively discovered non-hidden Markdown files without their .md suffix. Missing files are copied in both directions, creating parent directories.",
    "MCP source entries are filtered to supported shapes; occupied target names block copying even if unsupported. Claude JSON preserves unrelated top-level raw properties. Codex TOML appends converted sections to the held raw text. Codex bearer-token-env and env-http-header entries are excluded from the reverse direction. Allowed env and literal header fields can be carried across.",
    "Only selected items/categories are submitted. Primary Sync is disabled for zero selected items or while pending. Cancel is disabled while pending. Closing resets selection and expansion; successful mutation closes only with zero failures/unsupported entries. The diff query is invalidated after a resolved mutation."
  ],
  "architecture": {
    "classification": "LOCAL_CONFIG_COPY_WITH_POSSIBLE_MCP_SECRET_VALUES",
    "not_exclusively_architecture_excluded_cloud": true,
    "evidence": "Plugin Home supplies both roots; gn imports index M, and all immediate file operations pass that same local-host object. No remote host, VM, Reason cloud call, provider login transfer or Keychain operation occurs in this bounded chain.",
    "credential_caveat": "MCP args/env/headers/http_headers are copied as data and may contain credentials. Reading a whole local .claude.json in the reference can also load unrelated raw fields, although only mcpServers are merged. This is not proof credential copying is authorized for OpenConductor. No credential-bearing real file was read by this investigation.",
    "no_invented_equivalent": "The source contract includes all three categories. No cloud substitute or credentials-stripped local product replacement is proposed."
  },
